msgid "Apply Recommended Settings\nfor Low-Spec PC"
msgstr "使用建議偏好設定\n低階電腦適用"

msgid "Apply Recommended Settings\nfor Mid-Spec PC"
msgstr "使用建議偏好設定\n中階電腦適用"

msgid "Apply Recommended Settings\nfor High-Spec PC"
msgstr "使用建議偏好設定\n高階電腦適用"

msgid ""
"Use gdxsv recommended settings. Settings on other tabs will also be "
"modified.\n"
"\n"
"Low-Spec:\n"
"Prioritizes stability of gameplay by minimal load.\n"
"\n"
"Mid-Spec:\n"
"Well-balanced setting that allows for comfortable gameplay with medium "
"load.\n"
"\n"
"High-Spec:\n"
"Allows for comfortable gameplay by utilizing high load options."
msgstr ""
"使用開發者建議嘅偏好設定 (其他版嘅設定都會改埋)\n"
"\n"
"低階:\n"
"以穩定遊戲速度為優先，降低負荷而非追求流暢遊戲嘅設定\n"
"\n"
"中階:\n"
"流暢遊戲同負荷之間取個平衡嘅設定\n"
"\n"
"高階:\n"
"最爽亦係最高負荷嘅設定"

msgid "Use Texture Pack"
msgstr "高解像度紋理"

msgid "Use up-scaled textures."
msgstr "遊戲內使用高品質圖檔"

msgid ""
"Run the emulated CPU and GPU on different threads.\n"
"Can reduce the loading, but it may introduce a delay of 1 frame for input.\n"
"\tEnable = Best for low spec CPU.\n"
"\tDisable = Best for high spec CPU."
msgstr ""
"分拆GPU運算去另一線程，可以降低負荷但係有可能有 1 frame 輸入延遲\n"
"低階 CPU 建議啓用\n"
"高階 CPU 建議停用"

msgid "Enable 16:9 Widescreen Hack"
msgstr "使用 16:9 闊螢幕補丁"

msgid ""
"Use the following rendering options:\n"
"    rend.WideScreen=true\n"
"    rend.SuperWideScreen=true\n"
"    rend.WidescreenGameHacks=true"
msgstr "會將螢幕左右嘅黑邊去除，支援闊螢幕。(部分畫面可能會無法正確顯示)"

msgid ""
"Limit frame rate by VSync. Minimize video glitch"
msgstr ""
"等到 VSync 果吓先繪圖。\n"
"防止畫面撕裂，但係會增加輸入延遲。\n"
"如果唔覺有撕裂問題，建議停用。"

msgid ""
"Duplicate frames on high refresh rate monitors (120 Hz and higher)"
msgstr "會重複顯示同一個畫面兩次。120Hz螢幕適用。"

msgid "Network Settings"
msgstr "網絡設定"

msgid ""
"Automatically configure your network router for netplay (IPv4 Only)"
msgstr "會自動變更Router設定，幫你Port Forward（僅支援IPv4）"

msgid "Gdx UDP Port"
msgstr "UDP Port"

msgid ""
"UDP port number used for P2P communication. Cannot use the same number as "
"another application using."
msgstr "網絡對戰用嘅 UDP Port。\n唔可以同其他程式/電腦用一樣嘅 Port，會撞。"

msgid "UPnP Now"
msgstr "而家打通 UPnP"

msgid "Open the port using UPnP"
msgstr "試吓同 Router 開個 Port。"

msgid "Test Connectivity"
msgstr "測試連線能力"

msgid ""
"Analyzes your network for P2P play:\n"
"\n"
"OK (Direct): Ideal. Port Forwarding, UPnP, or Full Cone NAT detected.\n"
"OK (Hole Punching): Good. Moderate NAT detected. Hole Punching supported.\n"
"Limited (May use Relay): Restricted. Symmetric NAT detected. May require a "
"relay peer to connect."
msgstr ""
"分析你嘅網絡 P2P 對戰能力:\n"
"\n"
"OK (Direct): 完美。檢測到已手動開放 Port、UPnP 或 Full Cone NAT。\n"
"OK (Hole Punching): 良好。檢測到 Moderate NAT。支援 Hole Punching。\n"
"Limited (May use Relay): 差。檢測到 Symmetric NAT。你可能需要其他玩家幫你 Relay。"

msgid "Gdx Minimum Delay"
msgstr "最少輸入延遲"

msgid ""
"Minimum frame of input delay used for rollback communication.\n"
"Smaller value reduces latency, but uses more CPU and introduces glitches."
msgstr ""
"設定網絡對戰時最小輸入延遲。數値越細、輸入延遲越細，但會增加CPU負荷，並增加畫面跳格嘅可能性。"

msgid "Save Replay"
msgstr "儲存 Replay"

msgid "Save replay file to replays directory"
msgstr "儲存網絡對戰嘅重播檔案到重播資料夾。"

msgid "Upload Replay"
msgstr "上載 Replay"

msgid "Automatically upload the replay file after save"
msgstr "上載網絡對戰嘅重播檔案。"

msgid "Replay Folder"
msgstr "Replay 資料夾"

msgid "Folder where replay files are saved and listed, e.g. on an external drive.\nReplays already saved are not moved.\nIf the folder is not found, the default folder is used."
msgstr "儲存同列出重播檔案嘅資料夾，可以揀外置硬碟。\n已經儲存咗嘅重播唔會搬走。\n搵唔到資料夾嘅話，會用預設資料夾。"

msgid "Select the replay folder"
msgstr "揀 Replay 資料夾"

msgid "Display Network Statistics"
msgstr "對戰時顯示連線状態"

msgid ""
"Display network statistics on screen by default.\n"
"Use Flycast Menu button to show/hide."
msgstr ""
"網絡對戰時顯示連線状態。\n"
"按下Menu button可以切換顯示或隱藏。"

msgid "Enable UPnP"
msgstr "使用 UPnP"

msgid "Joystick Polling"
msgstr "搖桿 Polling"

msgid "Use polling instead of events for joystick input. May improve input latency in multi-threaded mode."
msgstr "使用Polling而非Event Trigger來獲取搖桿輸入。可能會改善多線程模式下的輸入延遲。"

